<section class="brain-spine-section">
  <h2 class="brain-spine-title">What Is Ayurvedic Infertility and Sexology Care?</h2>
  <div class="brain-spine-divider"></div>
  <p>Infertility and sexology conditions are a broad group of concerns affecting reproductive function and sexual health in both men and women. Common presentations include male infertility (low sperm count, poor motility, morphology abnormalities), female infertility (ovulatory dysfunction, unexplained infertility, hormonal infertility), erectile dysfunction, premature ejaculation and reduced sexual desire.</p>
  <p>At KSAC Hospitals, an Ayurvedic hospital in Hyderabad, Ayurvedic infertility and sexology care is delivered as a doctor supervised clinical programme with complete confidentiality. Each patient undergoes detailed assessment combining classical Ayurvedic evaluation with modern reproductive investigations before any care is planned. This evidence based Ayurveda in Hyderabad approach allows fertility and sexology care to be tailored alongside conventional reproductive medicine.</p>
  <p>Ayurvedic fertility and sexology care at KSAC Hospitals covers four broad areas: male fertility support, female fertility support, sexology care (erectile dysfunction, premature ejaculation, low libido) and preconception wellness for both partners.</p>
</section>

